  "title": "Asian Grilled Chicken",
  "description": "The flavorful marinade for these grilled chicken thighs is a little sweet, a little salty, and a little tangy, with a hint of spice from Asian chili sauce, curry, and garlic.",
  "authors": [
    "LoreleiLee"
